      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Welcome to Statebound!\nA game that you don\u2019t actually play.\n\nAliens
        impersonating chickens are here to steal your eggs.\nYou can\u2019t do anything
        to stop them\u2026 you\u2019re just a chicken.\n\nBut not a normal chicken.\nThrough
        mysterious chicken powers, you can spawn more aliens to fight chaos with
        chaos.\n\nControls:\nWASD to move\nSHIFT to sprint\nF to spawn more aliens\nMove
        your mouse to choose direction\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
